Add `POST /meetings/{domain}/{id}/link/refresh`, which drops and recreates a meeting's join link. Meeting join links are capability-bearing query-parameter URLs (`<base>/meeting-join/?key=<codeKey>&code=<codeValue>&domain=<domain>`) mirroring conversation join links: the stable `key` addresses the code row and the rotating `code` value is the capability, so refreshing invalidates every previously issued URL.
